{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14223140","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14223140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:0:1422314001:1":{"text":"宴を終えた翌朝","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9427B363A01709C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422314002:1":{"text":"メイジ<male>さん</male><female>さん</female>、それに使い魔の二人にお別れを言いに来たんだ。","source_cn":"魔法师<male>先生</male><female>小...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB71EB71A67E359F0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"メイジ<male>さん</male><female>さん</female>、それに使い魔の二人にお別れを言いに来たんだ。","female":"メイジ<male>さん</male><female>さん</female>、それに使い魔の二人にお別れを言いに来たんだ。","variant_male_record_index":"165290","variant_female_record_index":"165291","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422314003:1":{"text":"えっ！？帰ってきたばかりで、もうどこかに行くんですか？","source_cn":"欸？！你刚回家，这么快就要走了吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40C6E5896CF690F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422314004:1":{"text":"ああ。だが、今回はフェリダもターリも一緒だ。","source_cn":"是的，不过这次是我和弗瑞达、塔莉，我们三个一起走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB16CC1D78F47F0E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422314005:1":{"text":"昨夜、家族でたくさん話し合って決めたんです。夫の鍛造の腕前に、私の製錬技術が加われば必ず成功できる。","source_cn":"昨天晚上我们聊了很多，最后做出了这个决定。我想凭我的冶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x781A589B4385CB67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422314006:1":{"text":"たとえどんな困難にぶつかっても、三人が一緒なら必ず乗り越えられると。","source_cn":"以后哪怕遇到什么困难，也是我们三个一起面对了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45A80E16BCC9B469","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422314007:1":{"text":"そうよ！あたしも外の世界が見られるの、すごく楽しみ！","source_cn":"塔莉也想见识外面的世界，跟爸爸妈妈学冶炼、锻造和弹奏乐器！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14125E90633FAB4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422314008:1":{"text":"親切なメイジさんと使い魔さん、今度は外の世界で会いましょうね！","source_cn":"好心的魔法师和魔法使魔，我们一定会在外面的世界再见的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x185D621B21401A13","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"親切なメイジさんと使い魔さん、今度は外の世界で会いましょうね！","female":"親切なメイジさんと使い魔さん、今度は外の世界で会いましょうね！","variant_male_record_index":"165297","variant_female_record_index":"165298","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黒画面字幕","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:哈尔格":{"text":"ハルグ","source":"哈尔格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:弗瑞达":{"text":"フェリダ","source":"弗瑞达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔莉":{"text":"ターリ","source":"塔莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":5}}